#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
bin/gargamelle-haddock — Automated Hyperlinked Haddock Cross-Reference Verification Harness

Builds, cross-links, and validates hyperlinked Haddock documentation across all 11 packages:
  - gargamelle-core, gargamelle-logic, gargamelle-model, gargamelle-evidence
  - gargamelle-fol, gargamelle-equational, gargamelle-effect, gargamelle-persistence, gargamelle-sandbox
  - gargamelle-sheaf, gargamelle-workflow

Enforces:
  - --hyperlinked-source (per-token syntax highlighted Haskell source trees)
  - --quickjump (interactive documentation search indexes)
  - Zero out-of-scope identifier warnings ('sym' is out of scope)
  - Zero symbol ambiguity warnings ('sym' is ambiguous)
  - Unified cross-package API portal with Tier 1-3 categorization
"""

